It forces its allies to create coalitions to overthrow legitimate governments; 
break trade agreements; abandon and prohibit certain technologies and adopt 
unjustified judicial measures against citizens from the countries that refuse to submit.

We reject the attempts to expand NATO’s presence up to the Russian borders; 
the interference in Russia’s affairs with regard to its sovereignty and the imposition 
of unilateral and unjust sanctions against that country.
